{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Record clone review"},"description":"Sauvegarder les v\u00e9rifications r\u00e9ellement effectu\u00e9es, leurs preuves et anomalies dans le suivi persistant. 16 contr\u00f4les : header/body/footer/interactions pour 1600/820/390, et fid\u00e9lit\u00e9 source header/formulaires/animations/p\u00e9rim\u00e8tre. Les manques de composants ou d\u2019animations exigent leur impl\u00e9mentation avant validation. Seules les empreintes de zone/format modifi\u00e9es p\u00e9riment les contr\u00f4les ; ne pas rev\u00e9rifier les zones inchang\u00e9es. sourceUrl peut rattacher une ancienne page \u00e0 une r\u00e9f\u00e9rence fournie sans inventer une capture navigateur. componentSelection enregistre la s\u00e9lection explicite de l\u2019agent (liste vide autoris\u00e9e) ; les choix valid\u00e9s sont r\u00e9utilisables dans cet espace uniquement. issues accepte un lot jusqu\u2019\u00e0 2000 points dans 1 Mo ; ne pas imposer de d\u00e9coupage arbitraire. kind=missing-animation|missing-component exige implementation {revision,tests,visualEvidence} pour r\u00e9solution. Pas un outil de validation client.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"checks":{"default":[],"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"evidence":{"maxLength":500,"minLength":10,"type":"string"},"key":{"enum":["1600:header","1600:body","1600:footer","1600:interactions","820:header","820:body","820:footer","820:interactions","390:header","390:body","390:footer","390:interactions","source:header","source:forms","source:animations","source:scope","source:pages","source:sliders","source:decor"],"type":"string"}},"required":["key","evidence"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":19,"type":"array"},"componentSelection":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"complete":{"const":true,"type":"boolean"},"decidedBy":{"c